    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald are delighted to present this exceptional three-bedroom, two-bathroom, two-reception room semi-detached family home to the market. Beautifully maintained, the property benefits from a spacious open-plan extension added c. 2011, creating a wonderful family living space filled with natural light. Further features include a garage offering valuable storage or conversion potential (subject to the necessary planning permissions) and a generous paved driveway providing ample off-street parking.\nThe accommodation which extends to approximately 138.5 sq. m is arranged over two levels. The ground floor comprises an entrance hall, living room, family room, open-plan kitchen/dining room, utility room, shower room, and garage. Upstairs, there are three spacious double bedrooms and a family shower room. Outside, the property enjoys a walled front garden with generous off-street parking, while the private rear garden features a lawn and block built shed, creating an ideal space for relaxation, entertaining, and family enjoyment.\nThe property enjoys a highly convenient location just a short walk from the DART station. Donaghmede Shopping Centre and an excellent choice of primary and secondary schools all within easy reach. A variety of sporting and leisure facilities are available in the surrounding area, while Dublin Airport and the M1/M50 road networks are approximately a 20-minute drive away."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - 1.9m x 0.6m\nEntrance porch featuring a sliding door and tiled flooring.\n\nHall - 1.9m x 3.15m\nInviting entrance hall featuring laminate-effect timber flooring and an alarm control panel.\n\nLiving Room - 3.75m x 3.8m\nBright and comfortable living room featuring laminate-effect timber flooring, a fireplace and a TV point.\n\nFamily Room - 5.75m x 4.1m\nSpacious family room featuring laminate-effect timber flooring, an electric fireplace, and a TV point. Additional benefits include under-stairs storage and an open-plan layout leading into the kitchen/dining room.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 5.75m x 3.8m\nBright and spacious kitchen/dining room featuring a fitted kitchen with a double oven, gas hob, extractor fan, integrated fridge/freezer, and dishwasher. The room is finished with laminate-effect timber flooring and benefits from two Velux windows, while a sliding glass door provides direct access to the rear garden.\n\nUtility Room - 3.55m x 2.25m\nPractical utility room fitted with storage cabinetry, a sink unit, and plumbed for a washing machine. The room is finished with laminate-effect timber flooring and benefits from two Velux windows with a door providing direct access to the garage.\n\nShower Room - 1.95m x 2.35m\nFully tiled shower room featuring a Velux window. The suite comprises a WC, wash hand basin, walk-in electric shower, heated towel rail, and extractor fan.\n\nGarage - 2.25m x 4.55m\nGenerous garage featuring an up-and-over electric garage door to the front and fitted with lighting and power sockets.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 2.1m x 3.0m\nAccess to hot press.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.6m x 4.2m\nGenerous double bedroom situated to the rear of the property, featuring laminate-effect timber flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.3m x 3.8m\nDouble bedroom situated to the front of the property, featuring laminate-effect timber flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.45m x 2.8m\nDouble bedroom situated to the front of the property, featuring laminate-effect timber flooring.\n\nShower Room - 2.1m x 2.25m\nFully tiled shower room featuring a WC, wash hand basin, and corner electric shower. The room also benefits from access to the attic.\n\nOutside - \n\n\nFront garden - \nA well maintained walled front garden with attractive flower beds and a generous driveway providing off-street parking for up to three cars.\n\nRear garden - \nA private walled rear garden which features a well-maintained lawn and benefits from an outdoor tap, exterior lighting, and outdoor sockets. The garden further benefits from a block-built shed (approximately 7.4m x 3.1m).\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>3 bed, 2 bath semi-detached house</li><li>Open plan extension c. 2011</li><li>Double glazed windows</li><li>Gas fired central heating</li><li>Insulated</li><li>Garage</li><li>Utility room </li><li>Gated off street parking for 3 cars</li><li>Alarm</li><li>Excellent location</li><li>Close proximity to Dublin Airport and M1/M50</li><li>Approx. 138.5 sqm / 1,491 sqft</ul>"
      },
